WEBVTT

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.920
Go, go, go!

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:36.940
Body, mind,

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.760
soul,

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.760
and the soul of the owner.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.330
The racing car

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:46.310
is coming to the park.

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:49.550
The process

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:55.320
is going well.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:28.770
I'm not sure how to do this.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:01.220
We'll be right back.

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:48.360
Go, you're amazing! You're amazing!

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:49.070
Thank you.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.120
Jim Clark looks like he's going to lose.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:57.460
Go, we're out. We're in trouble.

00:03:57.460 --> 00:03:59.750
Go is a great racer.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.500
No.

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.380
Why don't you join our team and become a pro racer?

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:05.360
Sure.

00:04:05.360 --> 00:04:06.770
But...

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:09.470
I can't participate in the Grand Prix race.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:10.630
You can't.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:19.930
My father won't let you.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:25.590
Your father is a knight in my company.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:28.330
He'll understand if I ask him to.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.320
But...

00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:36.280
Go, leave it to the director.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:39.380
Director, I really want to be a racer.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.430
I really want to be a racer.

00:04:41.430 --> 00:04:46.000
You have the ability to line up with the racers of the world.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.050
Don't be discouraged, do your best.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:49.840
Yes, please.

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:53.900
Go, fly with this Mach, the world's best.

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:57.240
As expected of your father's design, it's very useful.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:05:00.000
My father is a fan of this Mach.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:07.700
I invented an engine that has more than 100% performance.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:12.060
That's why I designed this engine.

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:14.090
What the engine needs is horsepower.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:15.890
Powerpower equals rotation.

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:21.650
My GOV12 engine succeeded in raising the rotation to 30,000 rpm.

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:22.410
What? 30,000?

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:23.330
That's great.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:25.150
But how?

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:30.000
For the development of my company, I developed this GOV12 engine

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.660
I'm absolutely against it.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:36.310
I'm going to explain the G.O.V.12 engine from now on.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:38.520
There's a lot of explanations.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:39.420
What?

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:41.240
How do you know without explaining?

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:42.580
You stupid idiot.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:44.950
I understand, you stupid idiot.

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.110
What?

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.470
Mifune.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:48.520
Yes.

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.780
Onimura.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.310
Onimura, calm down.

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.590
But, president.

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:55.480
I'm also the chairman of this company.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.400
I'd like to give my opinion.

00:05:57.400 --> 00:06:00.000
The engine that Mifune invented is actually

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.000
It won't help.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.170
What?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.670
Don't look at my design.

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:04.670
What are you talking about?

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.500
You don't have to look at that.

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:07.700
It's a great idea,

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.700
but it won't turn the engine into a toy.

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:11.150
If you make something like that,

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:13.150
it will be an embarrassment to our company.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:14.700
President, please.

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.700
First of all, please test the first one.

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:18.840
But without a single approval,

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.340
we can't test it.

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:21.950
Do you think the company

00:06:21.950 --> 00:06:24.450
can give you a lot of money for your games?

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:25.270
Huh?

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:26.640
All right.

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:27.640
I'm counting on you.

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:30.000
Who is here?

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:32.710
You idiot!

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:34.710
You can do whatever you want with it.

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:35.660
Shut up!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.660
I'll make the engine complete with my own power!

00:06:38.660 --> 00:06:58.100
Your father is really tough.

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.000
He's just like you.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.440
I'll be back. I'll be back with my parents.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:07.610
The guy who was a kid, he was a kid. He was a kid. He was a kid.

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.650
This is the company's money.

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:11.480
- What? - It's not.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:14.380
Wait. How did my research have been done?

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:17.320
I don't have the trust. He's always the father-in-law.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:20.800
I'll take care of it!

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:22.340
Hey, hurry up and get out of here!

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:23.720
I'll take care of the car!

00:08:23.720 --> 00:08:24.900
What are you going to do, Kiraru?

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.080
Leave it to me!

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:27.280
Whoa, that's dangerous!

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:28.610
Come on!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.000
Come on, let go of the bag!

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:36.880
I'm going to get you!

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:44.440
Wait! Keep that bag! Samurai!

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:03.000
Ah, Michi!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.530
Michi!

00:10:06.530 --> 00:10:07.550
Michi!

00:10:07.550 --> 00:10:14.950
Search for the motorcycle on the highway!

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:19.650
My father's important bag has been stolen!

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:21.730
If you're an old man, get out of the way!

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.140
Okay, hurry up!

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.250
Roger, roger!

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:25.830
Don't think of anything else, Go!

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:34.360
Stop!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.410
Let's come to the party.

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:34.710
Thank you, Michi. The bag is safe.

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:36.610
How about I bring it to you?

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:38.910
You don't have to. I'm an old man who doesn't like it.

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.050
If the design is targeted,

00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:54.350
it means that my invention is worth it.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.760
Isn't that right, mother?

00:11:55.760 --> 00:11:56.760
That's right.

00:11:56.760 --> 00:12:00.000
But what are you going to do if you quit the company?

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:03.990
Why don't you renovate this house and start a maintenance factory?

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:05.620
Yeah, good idea!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.780
Mom, don't go! I'll work more!

00:12:07.780 --> 00:12:13.990
All right, I'll complete the G.O.V.12 engine and make the world a better place!

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:15.600
It's fun, it's fun!

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:18.760
But what are you going to do with that production budget?

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:20.190
Oh, I see.

00:12:20.190 --> 00:12:23.510
I'm sure you'll be able to do it if you work hard.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.410
That's right! There's no need to be pessimistic.

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:27.550
It's not that easy to make it!

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:29.960
I guess I can't do it.

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:39.420
I'll give you a treat, so don't cry.

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:46.960
I'm so tired of this.

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:48.710
Idiot!

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:51.230
Do you think you can get away with this?

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:53.930
I'm sorry. He's a very strong guy.

00:12:53.930 --> 00:12:56.010
And he's a very annoying guy.

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:57.320
Shut up!

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:58.740
You have a lot of excuses.

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:02.190
Heh heh heh heh heh heh.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:05.720
I didn't think it would be of any use to you, Chimpira.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.440
Why don't you give me five million yen?

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:09.310
It seems like it's my turn.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.870
What? Five million yen?

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:12.630
Yeah.

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:14.580
I'm Black, a little-known person.

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:16.290
If you don't like it, I don't mind.

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:19.850
If I make the design of Daisuke Mikune my specialty,

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:21.280
I'll get a lot of money.

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:24.220
All right, I'll do it.

00:13:24.220 --> 00:13:26.440
Leave the design to me.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:29.000
I'll give up on becoming a pro racer.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.000
I'll do my best.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:32.210
I've got to earn my father's production money.

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:49.730
Sub.

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:50.730
Yeah, Go.

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:52.290
Go, you're gonna make it, right?

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:53.290
You're my assistant.

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:54.290
Yeah.

00:13:54.290 --> 00:13:55.150
The engine is a V8.

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:57.420
It's very powerful.

00:13:57.420 --> 00:13:58.420
Hey, what's wrong?

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:00.000
You look pale.

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.370
Sabu, please sell my car.

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:04.160
What? You want to buy my car?

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:05.170
Yes.

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:06.680
You're an idiot, Go.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:09.920
I'm not against your father becoming a pro racer.

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.970
I don't mean that. I want money.

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.220
Money?

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.830
Go, you stink of water. Let go of me.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:17.860
I need money to build the engine.

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:21.350
I see. You're a man of your word. I can understand that.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.460
I've made up my mind. I'm counting on you.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:24.070
But...

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:25.960
Hey, look at this.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:28.480
Tsurugiyama Trial Race, $5,000.

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.350
Wow!

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.720
Why don't you try it, Go?

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.680
No way. My father's overheating all the time.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.920
But Mahago is better than me.

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:38.720
All right, let's do it.

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:39.440
It's decided.

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.880
Tsurugi-yama is a difficult course, so we have to keep Mahago in good shape.

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:44.470
Leave it to me.

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:45.590
I'm counting on you, Sabu.

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.260
It's okay.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:55.510
Who are you? Just knock it off.

00:14:55.510 --> 00:14:57.200
Oh, excuse me.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.000
This is the design of the G.O.V.12 engine.

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:01.310
I'd like to ask you a question.

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:03.050
Who the hell are you?

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:04.780
I am Black.

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:06.270
This is the big money.

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.900
I refuse!

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:09.830
Ha ha ha. Fine.

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:13.850
I don't want to waste my time, so I'll let you have it.

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:25.360
Now, where did you hide it?

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.650
Let me have it!

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:38.600
I'm going to go out again.

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:39.740
Who?

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:41.320
I'm here to steal the blueprint.

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:43.190
It's the ugly guy with the sword.

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:44.460
All right.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.530
Go! Leave him alone!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:58.660
It's so hot.

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.000
It's made of transparent ink.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:03.500
I don't even know what you're writing in the glass.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:10.600
Okay, it's finally done.

00:16:10.600 --> 00:16:12.600
I put a lot of effort into it to make it in time for the race.

00:16:12.600 --> 00:16:14.300
Now, it's time for the modification test.

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:15.300
I'm going to make it fly!

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:24.350
The current lap time is 1 minute and 31 seconds and 2 seconds.

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:25.350
Amazing!

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:26.690
You said it, didn't you?

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:28.190
The driver is good, right?

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:30.000
Hey, hey, the car's maintenance is good, too.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.540
I'd like you to go to the race, there's no doubt that you'll win the race.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:33.340
The race?

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:46.090
Ah, no, I mean, it doesn't matter which race it is, it's going to be perfect.

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:58.260
It's Genzo, isn't it?

00:16:58.260 --> 00:16:59.480
-Genzo? -Yes.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.650
They're not even good at the windmill. They're all dirty.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:57.440
Hey, Genzo, you can't participate in the race, you idiot!

00:17:57.440 --> 00:18:00.000
You were going to participate in the Tsurugiyama race? Interesting!

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:00.610
Sabu!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:01.950
Oh, no...

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.650
Goh, you can't beat me in that car.

00:18:03.650 --> 00:18:05.190
If you win, you have to race in Tsurugi-yama.

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:05.730
Got it?

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:10.050
There's a race in Tsurugi-yama, right?

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:11.520
I'm going to get in trouble.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:12.260
Idiot.

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:13.860
It's a secret from your father.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.680
Goh, your father's engine is worth a lot of money.

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:18.080
OK?

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.600
I'm not going to say it.

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:21.700
Sanpei, you have to say it, too.

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:30.000
All right, we're ready.

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:40.160
All right, okay.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:44.300
This Daishikeshi belt tire can run in the desert or on a mountain road,

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:46.300
without slipping.

00:18:46.300 --> 00:18:47.300
It's amazing.

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:49.790
Oh, no, there's no windscreen.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:50.840
Oh, I see.

00:18:50.840 --> 00:18:53.840
I forgot about the windscreen because I was too absorbed in it.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:55.730
Hey, if you don't hurry, you won't make it to the race.

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:56.940
It can't be helped.

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:57.940
Let's run without a windscreen.

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:59.060
Don't be reckless.

00:18:59.060 --> 00:19:00.000
You're weak.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:03.820
Oh!

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:05.610
I'm happy to hear that, Kuriboh.

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:06.260
What?

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:08.420
I'm not joking. This is my father's.

00:19:08.420 --> 00:19:10.140
I don't care. I don't care.

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:13.360
Leave my father to me.

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:16.680
I'm looking forward to it.

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:19.260
Brother Go is going to borrow some windmills.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:20.360
Windmills?

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:24.760
Go, Go, Go! Where is Go?

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:30.000
I don't know where he is.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:45.340
I drew it with clear ink, but if it breaks, it's all over.

00:19:46.520 --> 00:19:49.410
You thought well of hiding the design in the windscreen glass.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.470
I'll take it with my old car.

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:55.000
I'll hit you!

00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:15.530
The price is mine. I'll take the 5 million yen.

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:17.510
You're not going to lose!

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:24.050
I'll announce the grid positions.

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:26.000
No. 1, No. 2,

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.000
Inazuma, driver Sakai Genzo.

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:30.000
No. 2, No. 3,

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:33.210
No. 5, Mahago. Driver, Gou Mifune.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:37.110
No. 3, Zekken. No. 3, Lotus. Driver, Tadashi Hirose.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:04.270
That's ridiculous!

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:06.280
Do you know how many times I've told you?

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:08.280
It's going to be a big deal!

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:09.440
Idiot!

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:39.480
Be careful of the electric shock!

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:40.560
Hyaaaah!

00:22:25.630 --> 00:22:26.240
Yes, Subai.

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:42.610
- I'll kill you! - Go!

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:41.520
Hey, you seem to have got in the way.

00:23:42.300 --> 00:23:44.340
I don't like it when important cars get in the way.

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:04.040
Don't go to the car. You don't have to go to the house.

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:05.280
Ah, you are?

00:24:05.280 --> 00:24:15.400
Then you can take the glass of fire. You can give me a new gift. Or you can go to the earth?

00:24:15.400 --> 00:24:18.480
That's right. My father is going to the glass of fire.

00:24:18.480 --> 00:24:20.370
Take it!

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:23.620
You said well.

00:24:23.620 --> 00:24:24.390
Ah!

00:24:34.250 --> 00:24:36.280
Go, go, go, go!

00:25:34.060 --> 00:25:34.580
We'll be right back.
